{"body":"## SW-006 R1 交付\n\n### 摘要\n\n按 minimax.md 第 13 行 + SW-006 任务文件, R1 仅交付**零 API 草案** (PIL 程序化占位 + manifest + 4 检查图 + design_ref 指向 D-009 冻结 spec). 真实生图待 R2 在用户授权后启动 mcode-tools 8 次尝试预算.\n\n- 业务 head: 6ba654c5ba761ab25d94d121e985c5298d2d3d8a\n- 元数据 commit1: 6ba654c5ba761ab25d94d121e985c5298d2d3d8a (head_commit 回填)\n- 元数据 commit2: b1a775a4c3959cc23b759152bc9d474653726f5c (handoff 元数据)\n\n### 关键产物\n\n- 5 层 PIL 程序化占位 (1080x1920, 25-37KB each, total ~125KB < 2MB)\n- 每层 4 检查图 (alpha_mask+black+white+magenta) 共 20 张\n- manifest.json design_ref 指向 D-009 冻结 spec SHA 643e77b1...\n- SW-015 preflight 默认严格入口: **80/80 passed (0 failed)**\n- SW-015 dry_run 严格批准链: **11/11 passed**\n\n### Handoff\n\n详见 H-SW-006-R1.json + H-SW-006-R1.md.\n\n### 风险与待验证\n\n- R1 是零 API 草案, 不是真实生产级素材; 真实候选需在 mcode-tools 8 次尝试预算内生图替换\n- SW-006 registry status 仍 queued (PR #21 pending 字段说 ready 语义但 status 字段未改); Antigravity 须先把 SW-006.status 改 ready 才能启动付费调用\n- 用户必须明确授权后 minimax 启动 R2 真实生图\n\n请 Antigravity 独立审核 R-SW-006-R1.","headRefOid":"d71d6278860c3551b545bd3b476e38c77096622a","mergeable":"MERGEABLE","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-19T02:07:06Z","conclusion":"FAILURE","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/skydream9527-ctrl/sense-walk/actions/runs/39188385684/job/117855558058","name":"validate","startedAt":"2026-10-19T02:06:29Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Collaboration handoff checks"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-19T02:06:36Z","conclusion":"FAILURE","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/skydream9527-ctrl/sense-walk/actions/runs/39188380728/job/117855543017","name":"validate","startedAt":"2026-10-19T02:06:26Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Collaboration handoff checks"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-19T02:07:22Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/skydream9527-ctrl/sense-walk/actions/runs/39188385681/job/117855668452","name":"Source and ZCode handoff","startedAt":"2026-10-19T02:06:58Z","status":"C